{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_06",
  "title": "反艺术运动",
  "storyCode": "CR-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1ef0e07966a51a96ae0252316c23d87e4b57deba9245c7f2a0a17d24f512261e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区守卫",
      "text": "特克诺，老爹，外面来了好多士兵，架起了一道铁丝网，气势汹汹地堵在楼底下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "士兵？他们来干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区守卫",
      "text": "他们带着授权文件来，说是要彻查这里的消防隐患。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "啊......这是士兵该管的吗？不应该是那些傻头傻脑的政府机关人员来干这事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "特克诺，你带着社区里的老人和孩子离开这里，去罗德岛的办事处找埃内斯托。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "其他人抄上家伙和我走，今天咱们也别想睡好觉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "我、我要留在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "你的源石技艺是我们中最好的，把他们交给你我才放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "特克诺，记住我交代给你的任务，保护好那些人，无论发生什么，都以这件事为重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "......好，老爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "诸位来到这里到底是为了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "迪亚兹·冈萨雷斯，我记得你，从辛嘉斯的军队退伍后，你来到多索雷斯成为市消防局的一员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "在消防局待了五年，无数次在火场出入，换来的荣誉数都数不清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "怎么你现在却沦落到了这个破烂的地方呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "我是消防员，不论待在哪里，干的都是防火救灾的活儿，豪华酒店的火是火，街头巷尾的火也是火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "只要是火，我都能救，我都会救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "呵......迪亚兹你是内行人，肯定会积极配合我们的工作，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "少来这一套，你们打的主意我一清二楚，明面上说是消防检查，实际上只是为了赶人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "我们也是为了这里的安全着想，你也不想几年前的火灾重演吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "滚出去，这里的事情我会操心，轮不到你们来指手画脚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "唉，不行啊，迪亚兹，这场艺术节表演已经吸引了全市的目光，这里的事已经不光是你们的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "我们来这里，就是为了确保你们的表演不会给大家的生活造成不好的影响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "我说了，滚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "哎，老兄你还是不明白形势啊，既然要检查，我们怎么能不做准备呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "辛苦诸位好好查一查了，每一个危险源头都不要放过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "如果有人敢阻拦我们的检查，就是危害公共安全，直接动手吧，我们不用客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "军官的手下",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "这群混账......这群该死的混账。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "text": "特克诺姐姐，我怕......我们到底要去哪里啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "有坏人进到社区里来了，这里不安全，我送你们去埃内斯托先生那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的老人",
      "text": "那其他人呢......我们就把他们丢在这里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "......老爹只说让我看顾好你们......其他的......他会留下来安排。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "他们正在往这边来，我们得赶紧离开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "你们这是干什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的军官",
      "text": "排查木偶的每条供电线路，只要有隐患，就统统给我拆个干净。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "我好不容易搭设好的电路啊，你们给我停手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的军官",
      "text": "滚开吧你，真碍眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "这位军老爷，别这样，有话我们好好商量，我半年的心血啊......别拆了，求求你们别拆了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的军官",
      "text": "我管你搭了几个月，就你这种故意破坏用电安全与扰乱供电秩序的行为，把你送去监狱都不过分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "停手啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "别......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "军官的手下",
      "text": "*粗口*，哭哭啼啼烦死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区电工",
      "text": "呜......别......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "这是什么地方？这些家伙的老巢？想不到这么干净。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "军官的手下",
      "text": "报告，那两尊木偶就在窗外，一开窗户就能碰到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "看看这两尊大家伙，里面填充了多少泡沫塑料与木材，这要是着起火来可怎么得了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "拆，给我拆掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作业人员",
      "text": "你们这些混账，不得好死！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指挥人员",
      "text": "真是......一群到处撒野的东西......没有教养......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指挥人员",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作业人员",
      "text": "领队！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "都是怎么做事的？！不是都让你们把这些家伙统统带到外面的空地上去吗？磨磨蹭蹭干什么吃的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "军官的手下",
      "text": "他带着这群人一直挣扎个不停，我们很难控制住他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "像刚才那样狠狠朝他脑袋上来一下啊，你个蠢鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指挥人员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "你看，他现在多老实，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作业人员",
      "text": "畜生，你们这些畜生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恶劣的军官",
      "text": "还不赶紧把他们弄走，这么大两个木偶，拆起来可得费一番功夫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "前方不远处就是出口了，那些家伙应该不会想到这里来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "老人家，这里地上滑，我扶着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的老人",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "text": "特克诺，我们之后还会回来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "当然，这里是我们的家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "text": "但那些人来了，又是砸又是拆......等我们回来，又得花好长的时间把家里复原好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "他们会为此付出代价的，我发誓......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "等回来的时候，我会帮大家把坏掉的东西都复原好，我保证......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的老人",
      "text": "快走吧，离办事处还有好长一段路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "text": "奶奶，我也来扶着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "大家跟好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "特克诺？艾尼？快进来！你们怎么过来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "埃内斯托在哪里？我有事情找他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "他之前说有私事，一个人出去了，到现在还没有回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "只有我和艾拉小姐他们在这里，他们刚帮忙整理好要带去社区的物资，到底发生什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "联合政府的人将社区围起来了，借着消防检查的名头来破坏我们的艺术节表演......老爹让我带着他们来这里先躲躲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "特克诺......那现在是什么情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "艾拉小姐，我......我也不知道，来的路上到处都是他们打砸东西的声音......很多人都在哭，我不知道他们有没有受伤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "这些混蛋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "我、我现在得赶紧回去，我不放心老爹，他嘴上逞强说是要我先走，他来对付那些人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "但......他身体没有以前好了......年纪大了，嘴巴还不饶人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "我得走了，艾拉小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "别哭，特克诺，我们和你一起去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "text": "我们会帮你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "医生会留下来帮忙照顾那些老人和孩子，你可以放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "艾拉，特克诺带来的人没什么大碍，这里用不到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "现在更需要我帮忙的，应该是社区里的人，我也一起去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "这条通风管道未免也太长了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "身上全是灰，咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "怎么样，医生，你能下来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "我的臀部有些宽......好像有些卡住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "手给我，我拽你下来，\n呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "这些通风管道你们爬很适合，我光进去就很艰难了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "现在这里被围得水泄不通，原先逃跑的出路也有人看守，除了和我一起爬管子，再没有能进来的办法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "导火索，部署情况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "text": "情况比想象的复杂，在社区外有大量兵力守卫，我无法继续跟进，但炸弹已经设置完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "text": "随时可以启动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "窗外是什么情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "来的士兵人数远超我想象......大家都被他们带到外面了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "有人受伤吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "那有人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "没有，放心，没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "呼......那就好，那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "text": "艾拉，楼上有狙击手，我们得先去解决他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "text": "医生，你和特克诺留在这里，等我们的讯号再行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "你在找什么，特克诺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "存储器，大家的设计原稿都存在里面了，他们毁了我们的木偶，但只要存储器还在，迟早有天还能复现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "我来帮你找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷懒的军官",
      "text": "哟，原本我想着上来偷懒抽根烟，没想到撞上了几只偷偷摸摸的鼷兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "......他交给我来收拾，你去拿存储器，就在那边的柜子顶层。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷懒的军官",
      "text": "小朋友，你还是让你朋友来吧，就凭你个小身板，怕是连我的汗毛都碰不着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "唉......你何必惹她呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "你妈妈没有教过你不要小瞧别人吗？我非得狠狠揍你一顿不可！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷懒的军官",
      "text": "啊，我的脚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "什么小朋友？个子矮就是小朋友吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷懒的军官",
      "text": "我的鼻子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "小朋友，小你大爷的朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "偷懒的军官",
      "text": "呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "人我收拾掉了，存储器找到了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "坏消息，柜子顶层什么也没有，存储器被人拿走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "那......到底是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "别瞪着我了，迪亚兹先生，早说过让你们配合点，现在这么多人受伤，多不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "呸，事到如今你还摆着这副嘴脸给谁看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "给我把他按住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "嘶......你这家伙，下手还真狠，要不是带的人够多，搞不好今天就得交待在你的斧头下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "告诉你一个坏消息，此次检查我们发现了多处隐患，尤其是这对木偶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "要是开启它们，会严重影响整个社区的供电，甚至周边街区也有可能被波及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "所以我特意让大家都集中在了这里，给所有人一个警示。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "谁......到底是谁让你们来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "惦记这里的人不少......想把我们赶走的人也不少......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "但那些人只会冲着我们来......我们在做什么，他们根本不会在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "text": "你们去之后，首要的目标是毁掉那两个木娃娃，记住，一定要当着所有人的面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "text": "断水、断电、驱赶，那都是后面要做的事情，现在，我们得惹毛他们，激怒他们，然后......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "text": "让他们的怒火顺着引线烧到该去的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "text": "我会在那里等你们的好消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "除了那个人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "除了那个家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "既然你心中都有了答案，迪亚兹先生，何必再多问一句呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "人都到齐了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "动手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随着军官一声令下，等候在旁的士兵一拥而上，木偶的身体很快被拆解干净，制作材料与内部线路散落一地，只剩两颗头颅靠在一起。\n她们曾经灵动的眼珠从眼眶中脱落，露出里面断裂的线路。\n人群静默无声，很多人别开目光，不敢去看。\n只有迪亚兹，他从未偏过头，眼也不眨地看着面前的暴行，目眦欲裂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "哦，对了，我在一个柜子里找到了这个......存储器，我找人看过了，你们的设计原稿在里面，还有些其他杂七杂八的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "text": "你们今天毁掉的东西已经够多了，连最后一点也不打算放过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "我们得杜绝一切隐患，迪亚兹先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "静默的人群中传出一声细不可闻的啜泣，倔强如迪亚兹也忍不住垂下眼皮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "混账，把东西还给我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "什么人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "滚开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "可恶，竟然被抢走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "你们干什么吃的？谁把这丫头放过来的？给我把她抓住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "老实点，把东西交出来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "放开我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "还想施术？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "把东西给我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "呸，想都不要想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "还敢踹我？！*粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被特克诺一脚踹在脸上，军官气急败坏地将她推倒在地，试图强行抢夺，但杜林人始终没有松开攥紧存储器的那只手。\n几次尝试无果后，军官放弃了，他面无表情地站起身，然后抬脚重重踩在特克诺紧握的手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一脚又一脚，直到脚下一片血肉模糊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "松不松手？啊，松不松手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "不......不松......有、有本事......你就、就来拿啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在军官再次抬起膝盖时，一束红光从楼上遥遥射出，照在他的额间，汇成一个小小的红点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "你再踩一下试试？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "如果你想感受三颗不同的子弹同时击入你的身体，那就再踩一下试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "你......你怎么跑得那么慢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "因为我从四楼直接跳下来真的会摔死啊，特克诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "text": "......哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "text": "带着你的人离开这里，先生，不然招呼你的就不仅仅是子弹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "算了，该做的事情也都完成了......没必要和你们在这里耗着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "text": "通知其他人，我们是时候撤离了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
